WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.068 size:84% position:42%
-I love -- I love --
I love having you here.

00:00:02.068 --> 00:00:04.471 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thank you.
I'm gonna try and sit --

00:00:04.471 --> 00:00:07.073 size:84% position:42%
I have such short legs,
always, on these shows.

00:00:07.073 --> 00:00:07.741 size:78% position:39% line:92%
I'm always like this.

00:00:07.741 --> 00:00:12.278 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, you have them always,
not just on the show.

00:00:12.278 --> 00:00:12.812 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:12.812 --> 00:00:16.049
-No, I know,
but the chairs are so damn deep.

00:00:16.049 --> 00:00:17.484 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, really?
-Yeah.

00:00:17.484 --> 00:00:18.885 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm gonna talk to you
about whatever

00:00:18.885 --> 00:00:20.754 align:start size:94% position:6%
