chair-wise, for next time.

00:00:20.754 --> 00:00:22.255 align:start size:94% position:6%
We're gonna have a special --
-Thank you.

00:00:22.255 --> 00:00:24.090 line:92%
Gosh, Seth. Bring your "A" game.

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:26.626
-I love, by the way, that you're
going right at Blake Shelton.

00:00:26.626 --> 00:00:29.229 size:75% position:38%
This is what I hoped
with you as a coach.

00:00:29.229 --> 00:00:30.630 line:92%
Are you enjoying the transition

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:32.132 line:92%
to being a coach on "The Voice"?

00:00:32.132 --> 00:00:32.565 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yes.

00:00:32.565 --> 00:00:35.935 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, honestly, I love --
That's what makes this season

00:00:35.935 --> 00:00:37.704 align:start size:94% position:6%
especially fun, I think,
even for the crew.

00:00:37.704 --> 00:00:40.573 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, Adam and Blake and I
all know each other.

00:00:40.573 --> 00:00:41.775 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, and they know
Alicia really well,

00:00:41.775 --> 00:00:43.243 align:start size:94% position:6%
'cause they've done
a couple seasons with her.

00:00:43.243 --> 00:00:45.412 align:start size:94% position:6%
So it makes it really fun,
'cause the banter --

00:00:45.412 --> 00:00:49.549
We'll go in on each other, and
no one's like, "You're so mean."

00:00:49.549 --> 00:00:51.251 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, no one care--
You know, we're just, like --

00:00:51.251 --> 00:00:55.588
We're messing around, you know?
But I do go in on Blake a lot.

00:00:55.588 --> 00:00:56.089 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:00:56.089 --> 00:00:57.991 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But he's kind of
a giant target.

00:00:57.991 --> 00:01:00.093 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-Yeah. He's a giant man.

00:01:00.093 --> 00:01:01.995 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, when he
comes on this show,

00:01:01.995 --> 00:01:03.730 line:92%
his feet go through the floor.

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:07.200 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. Every time we do
a photo together for, like,

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:10.570 align:start size:94% position:6%
any promo you see, like,
I'm always on like two steps,

00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:13.206 align:start size:94% position:6%
like, or otherwise,
I look like an Oompa Loompa.

00:01:13.206 --> 00:01:16.076 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah. Yeah.
'Cause I'm like 5'3", so...

00:01:16.076 --> 00:01:19.212 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Do you like
selling yourself as a coach

00:01:19.212 --> 00:01:21.347 size:81% position:41%
or is that a hard part
of the show for you?

00:01:21.347 --> 00:01:22.715 line:92%
-I love it. I'm so competitive.

00:01:22.715 --> 00:01:24.984 size:84% position:42%
Like, yeah, I'm kind of
annoyingly competitive.

00:01:24.984 --> 00:01:25.985 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think a lot of
my friends are like,

00:01:25.985 --> 00:01:27.020 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Oh, you were
so fun last night."

00:01:27.020 --> 00:01:32.592
I'm like, "Well, wait, 'cause
there's a lot of personality

00:01:32.592 --> 00:01:33.193 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
coming at you."

00:01:33.193 --> 00:01:36.729 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I'm so excited about it
and I'm competitive.

00:01:36.729 --> 00:01:37.297 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
So I do enjoy it.

00:01:37.297 --> 00:01:39.566 align:start size:94% position:6%
But it sucks
when they don't pick you.

00:01:39.566 --> 00:01:41.468 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-You feel defeated.

00:01:41.468 --> 00:01:41.868 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Do you?

00:01:41.868 --> 00:01:44.003 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You feel like you're crap,
and they're like,

00:01:44.003 --> 00:01:45.171 line:92%
"I'm not gonna be on your team."

00:01:45.171 --> 00:01:46.005 line:92%
-You've had all this success.

00:01:46.005 --> 00:01:48.541
Even when a contestant on
"The Voice" doesn't choose you,

00:01:48.541 --> 00:01:49.342 size:84% position:42% line:92%
you take it personally.

00:01:49.342 --> 00:01:50.443 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, my God.
That's like all of us.

00:01:50.443 --> 00:01:52.679 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, we have a million people
who will be like,

00:01:52.679 --> 00:01:53.246 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
"You're awesome,"

00:01:53.246 --> 00:01:54.247 align:start size:94% position:6%
and, like, the one turd,
you're like,

00:01:54.247 --> 00:01:57.450 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Why don't
they think I'm great?

00:01:57.450 --> 00:01:58.885 size:78% position:39% line:92%
What did I do wrong?"

00:01:58.885 --> 00:01:59.686 line:92%
You know, it's like, "What?"

00:01:59.686 --> 00:02:01.454
-And then you say to the million
people who like you like,

00:02:01.454 --> 00:02:03.156 line:92%
"Why are you so stupid?!"

00:02:03.156 --> 00:02:05.859 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Why did you lie to me?!
-You liars!

00:02:05.859 --> 00:02:06.493 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-It was not great.

00:02:06.493 --> 00:02:08.495 size:75% position:38%
-I actually know you
to be competitive,

00:02:08.495 --> 00:02:10.563 align:start size:94% position:6%
because we did something --
Last time we hung out,

00:02:10.563 --> 00:02:13.333
we did something called "Day
Drinking with Seth and Kelly."

00:02:13.333 --> 00:02:15.568 align:start size:94% position:6%
And you told me you
were not a big drinker.

00:02:15.568 --> 00:02:16.136 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-I'm not.

00:02:16.136 --> 00:02:17.770 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And we drank a lot.
-Yes.

00:02:17.770 --> 00:02:19.572 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And you matched me
drink or drink.

00:02:19.572 --> 00:02:20.473 line:92%
-I did, but here's the thing.

00:02:20.473 --> 00:02:22.308 align:start size:94% position:6%
You tricked me,
'cause I thought, like,

00:02:22.308 --> 00:02:24.010 align:start size:94% position:6%
it was gonna be one of
those TV things,

00:02:24.010 --> 00:02:27.080 align:start size:94% position:6%
where, like,
really don't drink a lot.

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:29.315 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, like, I was so happy
when it came out,

00:02:29.315 --> 00:02:31.818 align:start size:94% position:6%
'cause, like,
there's a solid five minutes

00:02:31.818 --> 00:02:34.220 size:81% position:41%
where I didn't talk --
all I did was laugh --

00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:35.221 line:92%
that they had to edit out.

00:02:35.221 --> 00:02:38.091 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, I was so drunk.
-Yeah.

00:02:38.091 --> 00:02:41.494 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Like, it was so sad.
Like, I am a lightweight.

00:02:41.494 --> 00:02:43.296 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I was so drunk
that you were getting ready

00:02:43.296 --> 00:02:45.565 align:start size:94% position:6%
for the last thing --
'Cause we went on the roof

00:02:45.565 --> 00:02:47.066 align:start size:94% position:6%
of the hotel
to scream things out.

00:02:47.066 --> 00:02:50.670 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I fell asleep
on the roof of the hotel.

00:02:50.670 --> 00:02:51.604 line:92%
But we actually have a clip.

00:02:51.604 --> 00:02:54.207 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is us after
probably about 10 drinks each

00:02:54.207 --> 00:02:55.208 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
in only 2 hours.

00:02:55.208 --> 00:02:56.075 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-That's amazing.

00:02:56.075 --> 00:02:59.445 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Look, the important thing is
that we are on the roof

00:02:59.445 --> 00:03:01.714
and we have each written things
for the other person

00:03:01.714 --> 00:03:02.916 size:81% position:41% line:92%
to yell from the roof,

00:03:02.916 --> 00:03:05.952 align:start size:94% position:6%
because we've been
drinking all afternoon.

00:03:05.952 --> 00:03:08.254 align:start size:94% position:6%
All right,
I'm gonna yell one first.

00:03:08.254 --> 00:03:08.888 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-Okay, you pick one.

00:03:08.888 --> 00:03:12.225 size:88% position:44%
-I tried breast-feeding,
and it kind of worked!

00:03:12.225 --> 00:03:15.695 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I love the movie
"From Justin to Kelly"!

00:03:15.695 --> 00:03:17.397 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, I love it, too.
-It's good.

00:03:17.397 --> 00:03:19.499 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's so good.
-My moves are good.

00:03:19.499 --> 00:03:21.201 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's very underrated.
-My dance moves.

00:03:21.201 --> 00:03:21.701 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It's underrated.

00:03:21.701 --> 00:03:24.537 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, my God. We're so drunk.
-We're both drunk.

00:03:24.537 --> 00:03:26.706 align:start size:94% position:6%
You...
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:26.706 --> 00:03:30.276 size:88% position:44%
-I love that it's one --
Like, when you're drunk,

00:03:30.276 --> 00:03:32.045 size:84% position:42% line:92%
everything is one word.

00:03:32.045 --> 00:03:35.348 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, it's like...
[ Speaks indistinctly ]

00:03:35.348 --> 00:03:35.982 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It's like, "What?"

00:03:35.982 --> 00:03:38.551 size:81% position:41%
-I don't know if you
noticed this, but I --

00:03:38.551 --> 00:03:41.087 align:start size:94% position:6%
When I was leaving,
I said, "Oh, God.

00:03:41.087 --> 00:03:42.021 line:92%
I haven't said goodbye to Kelly.

00:03:42.021 --> 00:03:43.456 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I went over
and said goodbye,

00:03:43.456 --> 00:03:44.490 line:92%
and everybody told me later that

00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:45.892 line:92%
I had just said goodbye to you.

00:03:45.892 --> 00:03:46.759 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:46.759 --> 00:03:48.428 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's okay,
'cause you know what's funny?

00:03:48.428 --> 00:03:51.030 align:start size:94% position:6%
I didn't know that.
-Oh, okay. Good.

00:03:51.030 --> 00:03:52.498 size:81% position:41% line:92%
-I was legit hammered.

00:03:52.498 --> 00:03:56.169 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And you had to go to a --
-To my children.

00:03:56.169 --> 00:03:58.104 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:58.104 --> 00:03:59.505 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You went to your children?
-I did.

00:03:59.505 --> 00:04:00.406 line:92%
Luckily, my husband was there

00:04:00.406 --> 00:04:04.811 align:start size:94% position:6%
and a qualified nanny
that takes care of children.

00:04:04.811 --> 00:04:06.846 line:92%
Don't take my children away.

00:04:06.846 --> 00:04:09.182 align:start size:94% position:6%
No, I -- Literally, though,
it's kind of awesome,

00:04:09.182 --> 00:04:10.750 align:start size:94% position:6%
'cause I've never been
day drinking.

00:04:10.750 --> 00:04:12.552 align:start size:94% position:6%
Literally, that was my
one and only time.

00:04:12.552 --> 00:04:15.955
And it's awesome,
because you don't get hung over,

00:04:15.955 --> 00:04:18.625 line:92%
'cause you sober up by 6:30.

00:04:18.625 --> 00:04:19.325 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

00:04:19.325 --> 00:04:21.661 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And then you're like, "Well,
let's do this.

00:04:21.661 --> 00:04:22.795 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

00:04:22.795 --> 00:04:23.529 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-"I got this."

00:04:23.529 --> 00:04:25.932 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And, speaking of your kids,
aren't your kids now --

00:04:25.932 --> 00:04:28.701
'Cause I know you bring them on
the road with you all the time.

00:04:28.701 --> 00:04:30.036 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I bring them here.
They're here.

00:04:30.036 --> 00:04:31.738 align:start size:94% position:6%
-They're here.
And that's really great.

00:04:31.738 --> 00:04:32.939 align:start size:94% position:6%
You spend a lot of
time with them.

00:04:32.939 --> 00:04:34.207 align:start size:94% position:6%
Obviously, you wouldn't
see them that much

00:04:34.207 --> 00:04:35.108 align:start size:94% position:6%
'cause you're on
the road so much.

00:04:35.108 --> 00:04:39.078
-No. We work far too much, yeah.
-Are they excited now?

00:04:39.078 --> 00:04:41.481 align:start size:94% position:6%
Do they know your songs?
-Oh, yes.

00:04:41.481 --> 00:04:42.315 line:92%
But my daughter's hilarious,

00:04:42.315 --> 00:04:44.317 align:start size:94% position:6%
'cause she has no time
for Kelly Clarkson singing.

00:04:44.317 --> 00:04:48.488 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's like we'll start singing,
and she'll be like, "Shh."

00:04:48.488 --> 00:04:49.355 line:92%
She'll go right up to my mouth.

00:04:49.355 --> 00:04:52.859 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Shh. River's singing."
And I'm like, "Oh, my bad."

00:04:52.859 --> 00:04:56.162
I'm like, "People pay for this,
but whatever."

00:04:56.162 --> 00:04:58.798 size:78% position:39% line:92%
Like, she shushes me.

00:04:58.798 --> 00:05:01.934 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah. My son still likes it,
but, actually, he'll go,

00:05:01.934 --> 00:05:02.402 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
"Aaah!"

00:05:02.402 --> 00:05:05.538
Like, when you start singing,
if he doesn't like the song,

00:05:05.538 --> 00:05:06.639 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
he'll go, "Aaah!"

00:05:06.639 --> 00:05:09.242 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, I should
test my albums on him.

00:05:09.242 --> 00:05:09.942 size:81% position:41% line:92%
-Yeah. Very traumatic.

00:05:09.942 --> 00:05:13.446
It seems like your life with
your children is very traumatic.

00:05:13.446 --> 00:05:15.148 line:92%
-Well, not everyone sounds like

00:05:15.148 --> 00:05:17.083 line:92%
Julie Andrews in a field, y'all.

00:05:17.083 --> 00:05:19.552 size:75% position:38% line:92%
So, it's like I try.

